ricket, the winner is the team that has scored more points at the end of the game."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d01", "start": 343, "end": 395, "text": "There are multiple ways to score in a cricket match."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d01", "start": 396, "end": 456, "text": "The run, worth one point, is the most valuable scoring play."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d01", "start": 457, "end": 563, "text": "Tim Martin, a renowned figure in cricket, is known for his strategic insights and commentary on the sport."}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d02", "start": 0, "end": 80, "text": "Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License; additional terms may apply."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d02", "start": 81, "end": 150, "text": "By using this site, you agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d02", "start": 151, "end": 249, "text": "Wikipedia® is a registered trademark of the Wikimedia Foundation, Inc., a non-profit organization."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d02", "start": 250, "end": 466, "text": "Privacy policy About Wikipedia Disclaimers Contact Wikipedia Code of Conduct Developers Statistics Cookie statement Mobile view Search Search Toggle the table of contents Jim Martin (Ice Hockey) 2 languages Add topic"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0096-4f88bfe95462:d03", "start": 0, "end": 407, "text": "Seahawks players Temple Owls football players Washington Commanders players Hidden categories : Articles with short description Short description matches Wikidata Use mdy dates from January 2019 Short description is different from Wikidata Articles using infobox templates with no data rows Washington Commanders currentteam parameter arti